{"Title":"An Act relative to adding efficiency to paid family and medical leave","BillNumber":"H4270","DocketNumber":"HD4779","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"KIG1","Name":"Kenneth I. Gordon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KIG1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-08T16:44:56.743"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"KIG1","Name":"Kenneth I. Gordon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KIG1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-08T16:44:56.7433333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4270/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Gordon of Bedford, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Kenneth I. Gordon relative to administrative costs of the Department of Family and Medical Leave.  Labor and Workforce Development.","DocumentText":"\tSubsection (b) of section 7 of chapter 175M of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out the first sentence and inserting in place thereof the following sentence:- The costs of administering the department under this chapter shall be paid from the trust fund and in each fiscal year shall not exceed 5 per cent of the amount remaining in the fund at the end of the previous fiscal year; provided that, regardless of the trust fund balance at the end of a fiscal year, in no fiscal year shall the amount available to the director for administering the department decrease by more than 5 per cent from the previous year.  \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J43","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J43"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J24","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J24"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}